.TH DIODE-FAILURE-DETECTOR 1 "November 2026" "v5.1.0" "Diode Failure Detector Manual"
.SH NAME
technical_manual \- Technical Manual for the Diode Failure Detector Telemetry System
.SH SYNOPSIS
View full system documentation, architecture, and operational theory.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Diode Failure Detector is an integrated Linux kernel module (simple_telemetry) and high-performance Rust eGUI visualization application. It monitors synchronous brushless alternator excitation control systems and detects diode short and open circuit failures.
.SH PROCFS ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B /proc/simple-telemetry/stream
Streams real-time CSV snapshots: timestamp_ms, din, dout, short_alarm, open_alarm.
.TP
.B /proc/simple-telemetry/hz
Controls waveform frequency step (1 to 20).
.TP
.B /proc/simple-telemetry/t_lead
Adjusts time constant lead (>= 1).
.TP
.B /proc/simple-telemetry/t_lag
Adjusts time constant lag (>= 1).
.SH AUTHOR
Natska Natsagnyam NAMKHAI
